<h3><a id="user-content-shoutouts" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#shoutouts"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Shoutouts</h3>
<p>This package uses the <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20210723042306/https://github.com/niklasvh/html2canvas">html2canvas</a> library written by Niklas von Hertzen.
It also uses the indexedDb wrapper <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20210723042306/https://github.com/aaronpowell/db.js">db.js</a> written by Aaron Powell.
Thank you also to <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20210723042306/https://www.browserstack.com/" rel="nofollow">BrowserStack</a> for providing free chrome testing tools.</p>
